kiro-pixel-art
==============

This project is a port of the Claude Code plugin "pixel-plugin" to Kiro CLI.

Upstream project:
  willibrandon/pixel-plugin — https://github.com/willibrandon/pixel-plugin
  Copyright (c) 2025 Brandon Williams
  Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE.upstream).

The following material is derived from the upstream project and remains under
its original MIT License:
  - The pixel art skills under skills/pixel-art-* (SKILL.md, reference.md,
    examples.md, and format references).
  - The command definitions adapted into skills/pixel-{new,setup,export,palette,help}.
  - The pixel-mcp server binary (NOT redistributed here; downloaded by the
    installer from the upstream repository at install time).

The following material is original to this port:
  - agents/pixel-art.json (Kiro agent configuration)
  - install/install.sh and install/uninstall.sh
  - Kiro-specific frontmatter and tool-name adaptations
  - README.md

Aseprite (https://www.aseprite.org/) is a separate product with its own
license and is not included or redistributed by this project.
